'''Gift Bag''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 3rd tier in the Main Event during the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

==Appearance==
Its blade is solid black with a pile of gifts varying in sizes and colors over it. The guard and handle are red, resembling Santa’s gift bag, hence the name.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Gift Bag (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
